2. undergoing elective bone cancer resection surgery;
3. preoperative hemoglobin ≥12 g/dL;

Exclusion Criteria:

1. anticipated tourniquet use, endovascular balloon occlusion of the aorta or biopsy only;
2. weight \ 100Kg;
