Inclusion Criteria:

1. Sign a written informed consent form and voluntarily enroll in this study;
2. Be at least 18 years of age; gender is not a restriction;
3. Be a patient scheduled to receive treatment with Trastuzumab Rezetecan;
4. Have an ECOG performance status score of 0-2;
5. No ascites or pleural effusion requiring drainage;
