* 12-lead electrocardiogram No severe arrhythmias, and a mean Fridericia-corrected QT interval (QTc) of \<450 ms (males) or \<470 ms (females)
* Echocardiogram Left ventricular ejection fraction (LVEF) ≥ 50%
9. Agree to cooperate in completing daily nausea and vomiting logs and scale assessments;
